    {"id":"flood_power","prompt":"門外水在升，屋內、手部與電箱旁目前是乾的。總開關在眼前，我怎麼安排？","when":{"clock":{"eq":0}},"options":[{"id":"flood_power_ok","text":"我確認動線乾燥，再切斷屋內總電源。","class":"correct","safety":"safe","sourceIds":["power-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"principle","id":"flood_power_act_ok"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_power_ok"},{"id":"flood_power_myth","text":"我搬高延長線，再整理桌上的插頭。","class":"misconception","safety":"unsafe","sourceIds":["power-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"hazard","id":"flood_power_act_myth"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_power_myth"},{"id":"flood_power_risk","text":"我開著電器收拾物品，等水進來再處理。","class":"risk_or_delay","safety":"unsafe","sourceIds":["power-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"hazard","id":"flood_power_act_risk"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_power_risk"}]},
    {"id":"flood_wet_panel","prompt":"水已漫過玄關和去電箱的地板，樓梯另一側還乾，我現在怎麼做？","when":{"clock":{"eq":1}},"options":[{"id":"flood_wet_panel_ok","text":"我沿乾的樓梯上樓，避開電箱附近。","class":"correct","safety":"safe","sourceIds":["power-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"principle","id":"flood_wet_panel_act_ok"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_wet_panel_ok"},{"id":"flood_wet_panel_myth","text":"我在玄關鋪毛巾，再拿拖把吸水。","class":"misconception","safety":"unsafe","sourceIds":["power-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"hazard","id":"flood_wet_panel_act_myth"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_wet_panel_myth"},{"id":"flood_wet_panel_risk","text":"我踩水走到電箱，伸手確認開關位置。","class":"risk_or_delay","safety":"unsafe","sourceIds":["power-flood","wet-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"hazard","id":"flood_wet_panel_act_risk"},{"kind":"hazard","id":"flood_wet_panel_slip"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_wet_panel_risk"}]},
    {"id":"flood_basement","prompt":"地下車庫坡道開始進水。阿哲拿著車鑰匙，提議下去移車，我怎麼回他？","when":{"clock":{"eq":2}},"options":[{"id":"flood_basement_ok","text":"我勸阿哲放下車鑰匙，一起走上樓梯。","class":"correct","safety":"safe","sourceIds":["wet-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"principle","id":"flood_basement_act_ok"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_basement_ok"},{"id":"flood_basement_myth","text":"我留在梯口，請阿哲看看水深。","class":"misconception","safety":"unsafe","sourceIds":["wet-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"hazard","id":"flood_basement_act_myth"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_basement_myth"},{"id":"flood_basement_risk","text":"我跟他下到車庫移車，想把車開到高處。","class":"risk_or_delay","safety":"unsafe","sourceIds":["wet-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"hazard","id":"flood_basement_act_risk"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_basement_risk"}]},
    {"id":"flood_road","prompt":"我看見巷口道路積水，鄰居說車還能開。現在往哪裡避難？","when":{"clock":{"eq":3}},"options":[{"id":"flood_road_ok","text":"我留在樓上乾燥處，和阿哲等候聯絡。","class":"correct","safety":"safe","sourceIds":["road-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"principle","id":"flood_road_act_ok"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_road_ok"},{"id":"flood_road_myth","text":"我下到低梯口，揮手請巷口車子靠近。","class":"misconception","safety":"unsafe","sourceIds":["road-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"hazard","id":"flood_road_act_myth"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_road_myth"},{"id":"flood_road_risk","text":"我下樓開車穿過積水，想從巷口撤走。","class":"risk_or_delay","safety":"unsafe","sourceIds":["road-flood"],"steps":[{"kind":"hazard","id":"flood_road_act_risk"}],"cues":[],"effect":{},"narration":"option_flood_road_risk"}]},
